<title>USA: Arterial Vascular names Solano as COO.</title>
<headline>Arterial Vascular names Solano as COO.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA ROSA, Calif. 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Arterial Vascular Engineering Inc said it appointed Scott Solano as its chief operating officer effective February 3, 1997.</p>
<p>A spokesperson was unavailable to comment on whether Solano was replacing someone or filling a new position.</p>
</text>
